 📈 The dashboard: The S&amp;P 500 closed up 0.9% 

 A decline in oil prices trumped fears of rising inflation , ending a four-day slide for stocks. The S&amp;P 500 ended the short week down 0.8%. It's up 11.9% on the year. 🔥 Today's stock spotlight: Dell Technologies (+12%) jumped after an RBC analyst said the stock shows " no signs of slowing " amid a surge of AI infrastructure spending.

 
 
